      "message": "I didn\u0027t get why do we need allowDuplicates by reading the commit message.\nCan you clarify more and why will this is needed for sync failing case?\n\n\nAlso to reduce indentation,\nif (!allowDuplicates \u0026\u0026 isAddedToSelectSourceRequest(broadcastId, hasPriority)) {\n    log(\"addSelectSourceRequest: Already added\");\n    return;\n}",
